<title>GREECE: Greek Econ suspended from trading Thursday.</title>
<headline>Greek Econ suspended from trading Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The president of the Athens bourse, Manolis Xanthakis, suspended shares of metallurgical firm Econ from trading on Thursday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>Xanthakis took the decision after taking into consideration the high price volatility of Econ shares in the last few days and conflicting information on prospects for the firm, it said.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
